{"3949420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Runic Tower", "steam_appid": 3949420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tower Bound by Gods. A Defender Bound by Duty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Runic Tower</i> is a 3rd-person roguelike tower defense game where you fight to protect a living tower from relentless invaders. When the tower falls, the cycle begins again — each run forging new strategies, unlocking powers, and unveiling the dark forces behind the siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛡️ Defend in Depth</strong> – Face waves of cunning enemies, from agile bandits to ritual-bound monstrosities, each with unique AI behaviors, abilities, and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/eb6372f04fb3c4c3cadce95f52373c79.poster.avif?t=1783261904\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/eb6372f04fb3c4c3cadce95f52373c79.webm?t=1783261904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/eb6372f04fb3c4c3cadce95f52373c79.mp4?t=1783261904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Evolve Your Arsenal</strong> – Discover, combine, and upgrade abilities through a modular system designed for experimentation — or break the rules entirely with rare, reality-bending runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/386c5a17f73200adaca5d61bdc8eea2d.poster.avif?t=1783261904\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/386c5a17f73200adaca5d61bdc8eea2d.webm?t=1783261904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/386c5a17f73200adaca5d61bdc8eea2d.mp4?t=1783261904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌿A Living World</strong> – Every faction tells a story through combat. Bandits cut deals in the shadows, cultists bind horrors to their will, and monstrous Covenant creatures stalk the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/5354baffdd53bfc81a65e7d54a827f3f.avif?t=1783261904\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras_big/5354baffdd53bfc81a65e7d54a827f3f.avif?t=1783261904 width=1560 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>♻️ Die, Learn, Repeat</strong> – Runs end when the tower is destroyed, not when you fall. Return to the fight with new upgrades, meta-progression, and knowledge of your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/2ca56efd48503ceada59442dcc2a171f.poster.avif?t=1783261904\" width=800 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/2ca56efd48503ceada59442dcc2a171f.webm?t=1783261904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/2ca56efd48503ceada59442dcc2a171f.mp4?t=1783261904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\